      "detail": "Show that PilotFish can apply CMS Procedure-to-Procedure (PTP) NCCI edits as a business-rule layer on X12 837P claims: look up two procedure codes on the same encounter against an external PTP table and kick out pairs. We'll build that in 2 routes. Starting with a blank canvas on the first route.",
